<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="list_vehicles.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="list_vehicles">
    <!-- game::list_vehicles — the nearby-vehicle list (V screen, vehicles tab).
         A right-docked panel mirroring list_monsters: header (<Tab> Vehicles +
         active/total counter), a scrolling list of nearby vehicles (name left +
         distance/direction right), and the selected vehicle's detail info pane
         (speed, engine, wheels, status, cargo, leak/float flags as colour-tagged
         lines joined by <br/>). Render-only: keyboard owns nav + tab switching;
         the model is synced each frame from vehicle_list/iActive. Native scroll
         replaces the curses calcStartPos windowing. -->
    <div class="panel lv-panel">
        <div class="lv-header" data-rml="header_rml"></div>
        <div id="lv-list" class="lv-list scroll-pane">
            <div data-if="empty" class="lv-empty" data-rml="empty_rml"></div>
            <div class="lv-row" data-for="r : rows" data-class-selected="r.selected">
                <span class="lv-name" data-rml="r.name_rml"></span>
                <span class="lv-dist" data-rml="r.dist_rml"></span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div id="lv-info" class="lv-info scroll-pane" data-rml="info_rml"></div>
        <div class="lv-footer" data-rml="footer_rml"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
